error[E0277]: cannot append `Cons<A, notko_hlist::Empty>` onto `u8`
  --> tests/compile_fail/appending_onto_a_bare_type_is_refused.rs:12:39
   |
12 |     let _: core::marker::PhantomData<<u8 as Concat<One>>::Out> = core::marker::PhantomData;
   |                                       ^^ the trait `notko_hlist::Concat<Cons<A, notko_hlist::Empty>>` is not implemented for `u8`
   |
   = note: Concat walks the left-hand side, so `u8` has to be a list built from `Empty` and `Cons<H, T>`. The right-hand side is not walked and may be anything, which is why the error names the left one.
